## Problem

SEO Optimizer scans every product in a Shopify store for weak or missing SEO titles, meta descriptions, descriptions and image alt text, and flags duplicate or too-long titles.

## What it does

It scores each product and the whole store from 0 to 100, writes fixes with AI in the store's own voice, and shows a before/after for every field so the merchant decides what goes live.

- **Approval first.** Every change is reviewed before it is applied, and a dry run lets you preview changes without writing anything.
- **Safe undo.** Undo per product or per batch, and any field the merchant edited after the app wrote it is left alone.
- **Strict limits.** It edits only SEO title, SEO description, description and image alt, never price, inventory or variants, and it skips products tagged no-ai.

## Outcome

In the demo, fixing 12 products raised the store score from 77 to 90.

## How it's built

Built on React Router on Cloudflare Workers with D1, Workers AI, Shopify Admin GraphQL, App Bridge and Polaris. Free and Pro ($9/month) plans through Shopify billing switch on at public distribution.

## Stack

React Router, TypeScript, Cloudflare Workers, Cloudflare D1, Workers AI, Shopify Admin GraphQL, App Bridge and Polaris.
